'''Online Asset Library''' is a library of models from Project Zomboid and remodels of tiles used for [[Rendering|3D rendering]] inside [[wikipedia:Blender|Blender]]. The library link to provide Blender for access to the library assets is the following link, which should not be opened directly:

https://paddlefruit.github.io/ProjectZomboid_BlenderAssets/

{{Note|type=error|You need to be aware that while those assets are provided unofficially, they stay the property of [[The Indie Stone]] which has given its permission for redistribution, but they should solely be used for [[Project Zomboid]] related projects and the [[Modding#Terms & Conditions|terms and conditions]] should be strictly followed.}}

